  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5d9f1182fc3e41e8a2ae214deeea00d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Abysses.Level.PuzzleObjective
  ShowTopMostFoldoutHeaderGroup: 1
  floor: 4
  quadrant: -1
  label: "Triangulation du L\xE9viathan"
  labelEnglish: Leviathan triangulation
  hints:
  - "Le L\xE9viathan r\xF4de autour de la station. Chaque sonar mesure sa distance,
    en cases de la carte."
  - "Chacun lit la distance de SON sonar (coin de la carte \xE0 sa couleur) ; celle
    du r\xE9acteur, au centre, est la m\xEAme pour tous."
  - "Distance = cases en ligne droite, sans diagonale. Cherchez ensemble la case
    qui colle \xE0 toutes les distances, puis lettre + chiffre + FEU."
  hintsEnglish:
  - The Leviathan is circling the station. Each sonar measures its distance, in map
    tiles.
  - Everyone reads THEIR sonar's distance (map corner in their colour); the reactor's,
    in the centre, is the same for all.
  - Distance = tiles in straight lines, no diagonals. Find together the tile matching
    every distance, then letter + number + FIRE.
